  "Birds Pay Court to the Phoenix": {
   "rule": "Five-Virtue Phoenix Canon (passive art, layer 5, authored d36): Each hit your bird companions land lays on you the next Five-Colour Plumage colour you lack, at most once a pulse. Each time you spend a full plumage (five colours), you heal 3 % of your maximum health and your companions' next hits deal 30 % more.",
   "approx": "attaching this technique Effect at layer 5 awaits pending word technique-effects (runs when supplied via tree_effects); bird_empowered (cap 1) buffs the next companion hit because engine does not distinguish individual companion instances",
